id":"4oQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a99a325c-7245-448f-9e88-9cdf7ea6795e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"投げられる昆布","ts":"1614826424.001900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q1HBF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06af9366-2613-4c09-9724-ecc8b82d3930","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"めっちゃぶつける土鍋","ts":"1614826407.001500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oTVY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90923e65-5f74-4b70-8d3c-30af928a673a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"コンロ炊飯というか、土鍋炊飯で思い出すのが、コウノスさんの動画だなぁ… Youtube に移られて久しいですが","ts":"1614826041.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8tk"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"スレッドにコンロによるガチの美味しい炊飯方法書きます。","ts":"1614825275.000100","thread_ts":"1614825275.000100","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[March 4th, 2021 11:34 AM] koron: えっとガチのコンロ炊飯の方法は #\u003c#CCLJFJ58F|hobby-gourmet\u003e でw","author_id":"U06BRP8VD","author_name":"KoRoN","author_subname":"KoRoN","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U06BRP8VD","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/4b5a6f711a4e22e617b74058239ade53.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0007-48.png","text":"えっとガチのコンロ炊飯の方法は #\u003c#CCLJFJ58F|hobby-gourmet\u003e でw","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-gadget","ts":1614825244.452900,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1614825244452900"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OIx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d16d645-7fd2-42ed-9eae-30f14f05548d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"0. お米は研いでから30分ほどおいて水を吸わせる(その間水に漬けておく必要はない\n1. お米1に対してみず1.25の体積割合で鍋に投入\n    * 鍋は厚手で蓋が重めのものを選ぶ\n    * 都市ガスの場合、最低2合(1合=180ccのカップ)を炊いたほうが良い\n2. まずは強火で噴きだすまで\n3. そのあと弱火にして10分\n4. 火を止めて10分\n5. できあがり!\n\n超簡単","ts":"1614825543.000200","thread_ts":"1614825275.000100","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"To8c"}]}]
